Subject: [PATCH] Bridge generation-bound native root proof onto the OneWifi control queue

Publish HAL association identity and queue root admission on the native control
thread. Link loss quiesces only downstream backhaul APs; radio and fronthaul
configuration, native steering and measurement deadlines are unchanged.

--- a/include/wifi_events.h
+++ b/include/wifi_events.h
